## Project Context
{{ project_name }} — {{ description }}.

## Architecture
- **Backend**: FastAPI (Python 3.11+), async SQLAlchemy 2.0, Pydantic v2
- **Frontend**: React 18+ + Vite + TypeScript 5, TanStack Query v5, Tailwind CSS
- **Database**: PostgreSQL (primary), Redis (cache/queue)
- **Real-time**: WebSocket for live updates

## Code Standards
- Backend: PEP 8, Black formatter, strict mypy, Pydantic v2 for all schemas
- Frontend: ESLint + Prettier, strict TypeScript, functional components with hooks
- API: RESTful, OpenAPI 3.1 auto-docs at `/docs`, versioning via `/api/v1/`
- Testing: pytest (backend), Vitest + React Testing Library (frontend), Playwright (E2E)

## Commands
- `docker-compose up -d` — Start full stack
- `cd backend && uvicorn app.main:app --reload` — Run backend dev server
- `cd frontend && npm run dev` — Run frontend dev server
- `pytest` — Run backend tests
- `npm test` — Run frontend tests
- `alembic upgrade head` — Run database migrations

## Critical Rules
- NEVER commit `.env` files or secrets
- ALL database changes require Alembic migration
- API responses must include proper error handling
- Use async/await for all database and I/O operations
- Validate all user input with Pydantic schemas
